{"song_id": 6779706, "title": "A Name to the Face", "language": "en", "lyricists": "[255632, 508, 5828, 1066, 70, 24980]", "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "interlude", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "\"Who's this fucking CZAR\u2014? CZAR-FACE?\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "1", "text": "\"CZARFACE?\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "2", "text": "\"Doesn't make any sense\"", "rhyme": "#s"}, {"n": "3", "text": "\"Who is\u2014? That\u2014that's Inspectah Deck?\"", "rhyme": "Ek"}, {"n": "4", "text": "\"CZARFACE, for those who don't know is\u2014\"", "rhyme": "E"}, {"n": "5", "text": "\"Esoteric and Ins\u2014\" \"\u2014spectah Deck, 7L\"", "rhyme": "l"}, {"n": "6", "text": "\"CZAR-FACE\" (\"CZARFACE\")", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "7", "text": "\"I mean, just, wow\u2014wow\"", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "8", "text": "\"Inspectah Deck is a monster. You know he's the first\u2014probably one of the first rappers to have comic book references\"", "rhyme": "#s"}, {"n": "9", "text": "\"CZAR\u2014CZARFACE?", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "10", "text": "C'ZARFACE?", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "11", "text": "CZARFACE, why\u2014you know what I'm saying", "rhyme": "iN"}, {"n": "12", "text": "Oh, 'CZARFACE'", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "13", "text": "Yeah\"", "rhyme": "E"}, {"n": "14", "text": "\"Personally, I don't care which way they want it, only make up your mind\"", "rhyme": "#"}, {"n": "15", "text": "\"Excellent, CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "16", "text": "\"Maybe CZARFACE, how 'bout that?\"", "rhyme": "a"}, {"n": "17", "text": "\"CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "18", "text": "\"The one line, he goes, 'Sit your ass down like a Marvel end credit?!'", "rhyme": "i"}, {"n": "19", "text": "And another reason I love Esoteric", "rhyme": "ik"}, {"n": "20", "text": "Hahaha", "rhyme": "a"}, {"n": "21", "text": "And if you didn't know what the references were?\"", "rhyme": "eR"}, {"n": "22", "text": "\"Aw, here we go, hah\"", "rhyme": "a"}, {"n": "23", "text": "\"Ha-hahahaha!\"", "rhyme": "a"}, {"n": "24", "text": "\"Oh\"", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "25", "text": "\"New MF DOOM and CZARFACE collab\u2014Hopefully, I said 'CZARFACE' right\"", "rhyme": "ajt"}, {"n": "26", "text": "\"CZARFACE affrontera-t-il MF DOOM de nouveau?\"", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "27", "text": "\"CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "28", "text": "\"Once again\"", "rhyme": ")"}, {"n": "29", "text": "\"We're here with the gentlemen of CZARFACE!", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "30", "text": "Yeah, yeah", "rhyme": "E"}, {"n": "31", "text": "Do you prefer for one of you to be like colloquially known as 'CZAR' and the other 'FACE'? Or is it really like an allision of the two together?\"", "rhyme": "ER"}, {"n": "32", "text": "\"It's 'CZARFACE'\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "33", "text": "\"Inspectah Deck, Esoteric, and\u2014uh, 7L\"", "rhyme": "l"}, {"n": "34", "text": "\"CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "35", "text": "\"CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "36", "text": "\"It's C-Z-A-R\"", "rhyme": "9R"}, {"n": "37", "text": "\"Or is it CZARFACE, not Scarface?\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "38", "text": "\"I can't ever seem to say it right\"", "rhyme": "ajt"}, {"n": "39", "text": "\"CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "40", "text": "\"I personally fucking popped where he goes, um\u2014\"", "rhyme": "Om"}, {"n": "41", "text": "\"CZAR\u2014CZARFACE\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "42", "text": "\"I'll tell ya, the other day I was wearing my CZARFACE shirt, my buddy comes up to me, says, 'Hey, what's C-ZER-FACE?'", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "43", "text": "'Caesar-face?'", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "44", "text": "'C-ZER-FACE?!'\"", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "45", "text": "\"There is a lot more 'CZAR-ing' going on\u2014uh\u2014Harlem is now 'Czarlem'\u2014it's now a 'Czarrcade'", "rhyme": "ad"}, {"n": "46", "text": "Oh, yeah, it was 'Starrcade.' Producers are 'The Czar-Keys' instead of 'The Bar-Kays'", "rhyme": "i"}, {"n": "47", "text": "Oh, yeah, that's right!\"!", "rhyme": "ajt"}], "rhyme": "AABCDEAFBAAGADHAIAJKILIIFMFANADOAEAAPAMAQAAAARJM", "rhyme_vowel": "AABCCDAEBAAFACBAAAFFAGAAEAEAHACCADAAIAAAJAAAAAFA"}]}